From d6ca851909245e754c3cf7ba792cb736e8f529aa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dong Chenchen <superdcc97@163.com>
Date: Tue, 2 Jun 2026 16:48:13 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] mm: adapt mmap lock contention optimizations

Adapt the mmap_olk_opt series to the current branch.

Batch file-backed VMA insertions in dup_mmap() across a small set of address_space batches and batch unlink by address_space. Add dynamic i_mmap sharding for contended regular-file mappings, including shard-aware update paths and read-side walkers. Also keep VMA-lock fault retries on filemap and swap faults from falling back to mmap_lock when the fault can be retried under the VMA lock.

Signed-off-by: Dong Chenchen <superdcc97@163.com>
